<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-sanguozhi" book-id="b-sanguozhi-058" chapter-id="c-sanguozhi-058-appraisal" source-id="s-sanguozhi-058-appraisal">
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-058-appraisal:line090" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">評曰：「<persName id="c-sanguozhi-058-appraisal:line090:m0004" ref="5f2_396_25c">劉備</persName>天下稱雄，一世所憚，陸<persName id="c-sanguozhi-058-appraisal:line090:m0017" ref="lii_454_vuv">遜</persName>春秋方壯，威名未著，摧而克之，罔不如志。予既奇<persName id="c-sanguozhi-058-appraisal:line090:m0041" ref="lii_454_vuv">遜</persName>之謀略，又歎<persName id="c-sanguozhi-058-appraisal:line090:m0048" ref="572_278_cba">權</persName>之識才，所以濟大事也。及<persName id="c-sanguozhi-058-appraisal:line090:m0061" ref="lii_454_vuv">遜</persName>忠誠懇至，憂國亡身，庶幾社稷之臣矣。<persName id="c-sanguozhi-058-appraisal:line090:m0080" ref="40p_eb9_ggr">抗</persName>貞亮籌干，咸有父風，奕世載美，具體而微，可謂克構者哉!」</p>
</text>
